<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002X_S000H" variety="S000H">
<name>Body Exterior</name>
<ttl id="1002X_S000H_746RZ_T00D4" variety="T00D4">
<name>Center Pillar Stripe LH</name>
<para id="RM00000313S000X" category="A" type-id="80001" name-id="8215C-00" from="200612">
<name>Removal</name>
<subpara id="RM00000313S000X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM00000313S000X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AUI00000">
<ptxt>Remove Center Pillar Stripe LH</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using an infrared lamp, loosen the center pillar stripe LH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B156151" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Be careful of burns from the heated body or the heat of the infrared lamp.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Heat at 40-60°C for 3-5 minutes.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Raise the end of the center pillar stripe LH with a fingernail and peel it off parallel to the applied surface. </ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>